<title>USA: Waste recovery names David Greenstrein CEO.</title>
<headline>Waste recovery names David Greenstrein CEO.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Waste Recovery Inc said Friday it  named David Greenstein chief executive.</p>
<p>Greenstein replaces Thomas Earnshaw, who was appointed vice chairman.</p>
<p>Greenstein was previously the company's senior vice president.</p>
